  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Livestock Programming for Nutritional Improvements in Children Under 5 Years</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">To investigate the effect of the provision of livestock feed alone and a combination of livestock feed with nutrition counseling on reducing seasonal spikes in levels of acute malnutrition in children under 5 years and Pregnant and Lactating Women (PLW) in dry seasons.</narrative>
  </description>
